  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Correct statements among regarding silicones are:<br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math> They are polymers with hydrophobic character.<br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math> They are biocompatible.<br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></math> In general, they have high thermal stability and low dielectric strength.<br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Usually, they are resistant to oxidation and used as greases.</p>",
